      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city’s historic Landing covers 88 acres along the Minnesota River, showcasing life from 1840‑1890.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shakopee%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Shakopee’s historic district contains burial mounds built by prehistoric cultures, some 500‑2,000 years old.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shakopee%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Shakopee Heritage Society stewards the city’s history, architecture, and founding principles, working with local and state historical societies.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
