      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "other"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Downtown Shakopee hosts Turtle's 1890 Social Center, riverside concerts, and biweekly classic car shows, reflecting its 19th‑century commerce roots.",
